      <base-config cleartextTrafficPermitted="false">
          <trust-anchors>
              <certificates src="system" />
          </trust-anchors>
      </base-config>
  </network-security-config>
  ```
* **Local Data & Backup Security (MASVS-STORAGE-1):** Android manifest enforces `android:allowBackup="false"`, preventing local data extraction via ADB backup bridges.
* **Minimal Privileges (MASVS-PLATFORM-1):** Only non-intrusive permissions are requested:
